title: The Annual Budget
subtitle: A new year
face-image: img/budget.jpg
on-arrival: {!
// last year's figures, before anything changes
Q.last_total_income = Q.total_income;
Q.last_total_expenses = Q.total_expenses;
Q.budget_net = Q.total_income - Q.total_expenses;

// the state subsidy follows the last election result
var old_state = Q.income_state;
var last_result = Number(Q.a_vote);
if (!Number.isFinite(last_result)) last_result = Number(Q.a_r) || 0;
Q.income_state = Math.floor(last_result / 10);
Q.state_change = Q.income_state - old_state;

Q.total_expenses = Q.expense_apparatus + Q.expense_local_chapters + Q.expense_newspaper + Q.expense_dsu;
Q.total_income = Q.dues + Q.income_lo + Q.income_state + Q.income_other;

Q.economic_growth += 1;
!}

= The [+ year +] Budget

The treasurer spreads last year's ledgers across the table, and the central committee settles in to reckon with the books.

{!<table class="budget-table">!}
{!<tr><th colspan="2">!}Last year, per month{!</th></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}Income{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ last_total_income +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}Expenses{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ last_total_expenses +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="balance"><td>!}[? if budget_net >= 0 : Surplus ?][? if budget_net < 0 : Deficit ?]{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if budget_net >= 0 : +[+ budget_net +] ?][? if budget_net < 0 : −[+ 0 - budget_net +] ?]{!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

[? if state_change > 0 : Thanks to our gains at the last election, the state subsidy rises to [+ income_state +] a month. ?][? if state_change < 0 : After our losses at the last election, the state subsidy falls to [+ income_state +] a month. ?]

[? if dissent <= 0.15 : Spirits are high across the party - our members, and perhaps our allies in LO, may be willing to give a little more this year. ?][? if dissent > 0.6 : With dissent running this high, now is not the moment to ask more of our members. ?][? if dissent > 0.15 and dissent <= 0.6 and lo_relations >= 75 : Our strong standing with LO suggests they might be open to greater support this year. ?][? if dissent > 0.15 and dissent <= 0.6 and lo_relations <= 30 : Our poor standing with LO makes further requests for money unlikely to succeed. ?] [? if mediahealth >= 80 : Our press has rarely been in better health, reaching more readers than ever. ?][? if mediahealth <= 20 : Our newspapers are struggling badly, and readers are drifting away. ?] [? if efc >= 1.2 : The party machine is running better than we could have hoped. ?][? if efc <= 0.6 : The party machine feels sluggish and understaffed. ?] [? if expense_dsu >= 3 : DSU has never been better funded, and it shows in their energy. ?][? if expense_dsu <= 0 : Our youth wing feels badly neglected. ?]

- @what_expenses: Turn to the new budget.


@what_expenses
on-arrival: {!
Q.total_expenses = Q.expense_apparatus + Q.expense_local_chapters + Q.expense_newspaper + Q.expense_dsu;
Q.total_income = Q.dues + Q.income_lo + Q.income_state + Q.income_other;
!}

= The [+ year +] Budget

The floor is open. Every line can be changed before the committee approves the budget.

{!<table class="budget-table">!}
{!<tr><th colspan="2">!}Income, per month{!</th><th colspan="2">!}Expenses, per month{!</th></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="Paid by every member. Higher dues bring in more money, but weigh heavily on poorer and unemployed members.">!}Dues{!</span></td><td class="num">!}+[+ dues +]{!</td><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="Our professional staff. A larger apparatus compensates for a weaker membership, but discourages grassroots activity.">!}Apparatus{!</span></td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_apparatus +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="The trade union confederation's contribution. It only grows if we negotiate for it, and every request tries LO's patience.">!}LO{!</span></td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_lo +]{!</td><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="Funding for our branches. Well-funded chapters keep members active and reduce dissent - more so the larger our membership.">!}Local chapters{!</span></td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_local_chapters +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="Follows our result at the last election.">!}State{!</span></td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_state +]{!</td><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="Subsidies for our press. A well-funded press reduces dissent and keeps our media healthy.">!}Newspapers{!</span></td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_newspaper +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}[? if income_other > 0 : Other ?]{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if income_other > 0 : +[+ income_other +] ?]{!</td><td><span class="tooltip-text" title="Funding for DSU, our youth party. A well-funded youth wing eases dissent on the left and draws in new members.">!}Youth party{!</span></td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_dsu +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="total"><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}+[+ total_income +]{!</span></td><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}−[+ total_expenses +]{!</span></td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="balance"><td colspan="3">!}Monthly balance{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if total_income >= total_expenses : +[+ total_income - total_expenses +] ?][? if total_income < total_expenses : −[+ total_expenses - total_income +] ?]{!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

- @fund_options: Increase funding for one of our organisations.
- @austerity_options: Cut spending.
- @income_options: Raise more income.
- @change_b: Approve the budget as it stands.


@fund_options
on-arrival: {!
Q.total_expenses = Q.expense_apparatus + Q.expense_local_chapters + Q.expense_newspaper + Q.expense_dsu;
Q.total_income = Q.dues + Q.income_lo + Q.income_state + Q.income_other;
!}

= Increasing Funding

Delegates from every wing of the party press their case for a larger share of the money.

{!<table class="budget-table">!}
{!<tr><th colspan="2">!}Income, per month{!</th><th colspan="2">!}Expenses, per month{!</th></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}Dues{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ dues +]{!</td><td>!}Apparatus{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_apparatus +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}LO{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_lo +]{!</td><td>!}Local chapters{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_local_chapters +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}State{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_state +]{!</td><td>!}Newspapers{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_newspaper +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}[? if income_other > 0 : Other ?]{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if income_other > 0 : +[+ income_other +] ?]{!</td><td>!}Youth party{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_dsu +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="total"><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}+[+ total_income +]{!</span></td><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}−[+ total_expenses +]{!</span></td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="balance"><td colspan="3">!}Monthly balance{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if total_income >= total_expenses : +[+ total_income - total_expenses +] ?][? if total_income < total_expenses : −[+ total_expenses - total_income +] ?]{!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

Which organisation should receive more?

- @more_newspaper: The newspapers.
- @more_administration: The apparatus.
- @more_local_chapters: The local chapters.
- @more_youth_party: The youth party.
- @austerity_options: Cut spending instead.
- @income_options: Raise more income instead.
- @what_expenses: Back to the overview.
- @change_b: Approve the budget.


@more_newspaper
subtitle: +1 a month. Reduces dissent and keeps our press healthy.
choose-if: total_expenses + 1 <= total_income
unavailable-subtitle: We can't afford this without running a deficit.
on-arrival: expense_newspaper += 1; resources -= 1;
go-to: fund_options

@more_administration
subtitle: +1 a month. Compensates for a weaker membership, but discourages grassroots activity.
choose-if: total_expenses + 1 <= total_income
unavailable-subtitle: We can't afford this without running a deficit.
on-arrival: expense_apparatus += 1; resources -= 1;
go-to: fund_options

@more_local_chapters
subtitle: +1 a month. Keeps members active and reduces dissent - more so the larger our membership.
choose-if: total_expenses + 1 <= total_income
unavailable-subtitle: We can't afford this without running a deficit.
on-arrival: expense_local_chapters += 1; resources -= 1;
go-to: fund_options

@more_youth_party
subtitle: +1 a month. Eases dissent on the left and draws in new members.
choose-if: total_expenses + 1 <= total_income
unavailable-subtitle: We can't afford this without running a deficit.
on-arrival: expense_dsu += 1; resources -= 1;
go-to: fund_options


@austerity_options
on-arrival: {!
Q.total_expenses = Q.expense_apparatus + Q.expense_local_chapters + Q.expense_newspaper + Q.expense_dsu;
Q.total_income = Q.dues + Q.income_lo + Q.income_state + Q.income_other;
!}

= Cutting Spending

A grim mood settles over the room as the treasurer suggests where the knife might fall.

{!<table class="budget-table">!}
{!<tr><th colspan="2">!}Income, per month{!</th><th colspan="2">!}Expenses, per month{!</th></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}Dues{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ dues +]{!</td><td>!}Apparatus{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_apparatus +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}LO{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_lo +]{!</td><td>!}Local chapters{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_local_chapters +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}State{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_state +]{!</td><td>!}Newspapers{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_newspaper +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}[? if income_other > 0 : Other ?]{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if income_other > 0 : +[+ income_other +] ?]{!</td><td>!}Youth party{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_dsu +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="total"><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}+[+ total_income +]{!</span></td><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}−[+ total_expenses +]{!</span></td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="balance"><td colspan="3">!}Monthly balance{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if total_income >= total_expenses : +[+ total_income - total_expenses +] ?][? if total_income < total_expenses : −[+ total_expenses - total_income +] ?]{!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

Where should we cut?

- @less_newspaper: The newspapers.
- @less_administration: The apparatus.
- @less_local_chapters: The local chapters.
- @less_youth_party: The youth party.
- @fund_options: Increase funding instead.
- @income_options: Raise more income instead.
- @what_expenses: Back to the overview.
- @change_b: Approve the budget.


@less_newspaper
subtitle: -1 a month. Raises dissent and lets our press decline.
choose-if: expense_newspaper > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The newspapers receive nothing already.
on-arrival: expense_newspaper -= 1; resources += 1;
go-to: austerity_options

@less_administration
subtitle: -1 a month. Weakens the party machine, but frees members for grassroots activity.
choose-if: expense_apparatus > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The apparatus receives nothing already.
on-arrival: expense_apparatus -= 1; resources += 1;
go-to: austerity_options

@less_local_chapters
subtitle: -1 a month. Raises dissent and leaves our branches less active.
choose-if: expense_local_chapters > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The local chapters receive nothing already.
on-arrival: expense_local_chapters -= 1; resources += 1;
go-to: austerity_options

@less_youth_party
subtitle: -1 a month. Raises dissent on the left and slows our membership growth.
choose-if: expense_dsu > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The youth party receives nothing already.
on-arrival: expense_dsu -= 1; resources += 1;
go-to: austerity_options


@income_options
on-arrival: {!
Q.total_expenses = Q.expense_apparatus + Q.expense_local_chapters + Q.expense_newspaper + Q.expense_dsu;
Q.total_income = Q.dues + Q.income_lo + Q.income_state + Q.income_other;
!}

= Raising Income

Talk turns to where the money might come from.

{!<table class="budget-table">!}
{!<tr><th colspan="2">!}Income, per month{!</th><th colspan="2">!}Expenses, per month{!</th></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}Dues{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ dues +]{!</td><td>!}Apparatus{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_apparatus +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}LO{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_lo +]{!</td><td>!}Local chapters{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_local_chapters +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}State{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_state +]{!</td><td>!}Newspapers{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_newspaper +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}[? if income_other > 0 : Other ?]{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if income_other > 0 : +[+ income_other +] ?]{!</td><td>!}Youth party{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_dsu +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="total"><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}+[+ total_income +]{!</span></td><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}−[+ total_expenses +]{!</span></td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="balance"><td colspan="3">!}Monthly balance{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if total_income >= total_expenses : +[+ total_income - total_expenses +] ?][? if total_income < total_expenses : −[+ total_expenses - total_income +] ?]{!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

How should we raise more?

- @raise_dues: Raise membership dues.
- @lower_dues: Lower membership dues.
- @negotiate_lo: Ask LO for more support.
- @state_funding_explainer: Why does the state pay us at all?
- @fund_options: Increase funding instead.
- @austerity_options: Cut spending instead.
- @what_expenses: Back to the overview.
- @change_b: Approve the budget.


@raise_dues
subtitle: +1 a month, and +1 at once. Costs support among poorer and unemployed workers - more so when unemployment is high.
choose-if: dues <= 4
unavailable-subtitle: Our members won't bear any higher dues.
on-arrival: {!
Q.dues += 1;
Q.resources += 1;

(Q.addsupport ? Q.addsupport : addsupport)('tenant_workers', 'a', -3);
Q.unemployed_a -= 3;

if (Q.unemployed >= 7) {
  (Q.addsupport ? Q.addsupport : addsupport)('workers', 'a', -5);
  Q.unemployed_a -= 10;
}

if (Q.dues >= 5) {
  (Q.addsupport ? Q.addsupport : addsupport)('workers', 'a', -3 * Q.dues);
  Q.unemployed_a -= 3 * Q.dues;
}
!}
go-to: income_options

@lower_dues
subtitle: -1 a month. Eases dissent across every faction.
choose-if: dues > 1
unavailable-subtitle: Dues are already as low as they can go.
on-arrival: dues -= 1; left_dissent -= 8; left_worker_dissent -= 8; right_worker_dissent -= 8; technocrat_dissent -= 8;
go-to: income_options

@negotiate_lo
subtitle: +1 a month, but every request tries LO's patience.
choose-if: lo_relations >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: Relations with LO are too strained to ask for more right now.
on-arrival: income_lo += 1; lo_relations -= 6;

= Talks with LO

LO agrees to raise its contribution to [+ income_lo +] a month - though its leadership is visibly tiring of our requests. Our relations with LO are now [+ lo_relations : lo_relations +].

- @income_options: Back to income.

@state_funding_explainer

= The State Subsidy

Officially, this isn't public party financing - no such thing exists yet. On paper, the subsidy is earmarked for hiring policy experts to advise our parliamentary group, and its size follows our result at the last election. In practice, nobody checks what the money is actually spent on.

- @income_options: Back to income.


@change_b
on-arrival: {!
Q.total_expenses = Q.expense_apparatus + Q.expense_local_chapters + Q.expense_newspaper + Q.expense_dsu;
Q.total_income = Q.dues + Q.income_lo + Q.income_state + Q.income_other;

Q.yearly_budget_expense_apparatus = Q.expense_apparatus;
Q.yearly_budget_expense_local_chapters = Q.expense_local_chapters;
Q.yearly_budget_expense_newspaper = Q.expense_newspaper;
Q.yearly_budget_expense_dsu = Q.expense_dsu;
Q.yearly_budget_dues = Q.dues;
Q.yearly_budget_income_lo = Q.income_lo;
Q.yearly_budget_income_state = Q.income_state;
Q.yearly_budget_income_other = Q.income_other;
!}

= The [+ year +] Budget is Approved

A light applause fills the central committee. Someone wipes their forehead - we have a new budget.

{!<table class="budget-table">!}
{!<tr><th colspan="2">!}Income, per month{!</th><th colspan="2">!}Expenses, per month{!</th></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}Dues{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ dues +]{!</td><td>!}Apparatus{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_apparatus +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}LO{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_lo +]{!</td><td>!}Local chapters{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_local_chapters +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}State{!</td><td class="num">!}+[+ income_state +]{!</td><td>!}Newspapers{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_newspaper +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td>!}[? if income_other > 0 : Other ?]{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if income_other > 0 : +[+ income_other +] ?]{!</td><td>!}Youth party{!</td><td class="num">!}−[+ expense_dsu +]{!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="total"><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}+[+ total_income +]{!</span></td><td><span class="double-underline">!}Total{!</span></td><td class="num"><span class="double-underline">!}−[+ total_expenses +]{!</span></td></tr>!}
{!<tr class="balance"><td colspan="3">!}Monthly balance{!</td><td class="num">!}[? if total_income >= total_expenses : +[+ total_income - total_expenses +] ?][? if total_income < total_expenses : −[+ total_expenses - total_income +] ?]{!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

The monthly balance will be added to our resources each month.
